# Repository line-ending policy (SB-OPS-REPO-HOUSEKEEPING-1.4, HK-066).
# Git auto-detects text; detected text is stored and checked out with LF on
# every platform, overriding a local core.autocrlf setting.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary asset types present in the repository: no EOL conversion or text diff.
*.png binary
*.ico binary
